        "reference": "FLAVOR_TEXT",
        "subject": "Flavor Text"
      },
      "translations": {
        "en_US": {
          "text": "Theoretically, transdifferentiation can go on indefinitely, effectively rendering the jellyfish biologically immortal... and squishy.",
          "locale": "en_US"
        },
        "es_ES": {
          "text": "En teoría, la transdiferenciación puede continuar indefinidamente, por lo que la medusa es biológicamente inmortal... y físicamente blandita.",
          "locale": "es_ES"
        },
        "fr_FR": {
          "text": "En théorie, la transdifférenciation peut se poursuivre indéfiniment, rendant ainsi la méduse biologiquement immortelle... et visqueuse.",
          "locale": "fr_FR"
        },
        "it_IT": {
          "text": "In teoria, la transdifferenziazione può andare avanti all'infinito, rendendo le meduse biologicamente immortali... e mollicce.",
          "locale": "it_IT"
        },
        "de_DE": {
          "text": "Theoretisch kann die Transdifferenzierung unbegrenzt fortgesetzt werden, sodass die Qualle biologisch unsterblich wird ... und matschig.",
          "locale": "de_DE"
        }
      },
      "id": "01JV4TAWE282P974GMBE8J4465",
      "text": "Theoretically, transdifferentiation can go on indefinitely, effectively rendering the jellyfish biologically immortal... and squishy."
    }
  ],
